        "TileImage": "$($repository 0afcc59e-6d6e-433f-8404-7699df872c9d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. One of the three owners of the Haven Island Resort, Ludjmilla Vetrova, has decided to consolodate power for herself, after discovering her husband, Tyson Williams, has been spying on her. He and the other Owner, Steven Bradly have been conspiring to oust her from the company as they belive she has grown too influential among the clientel. To secure her sole ownership Vetrova has asked us to eliminate Bradly, Tyson Williams, his Right Hand Man and his Butler.\rHappy Hunting, 47",
